    "findings": [
      "Rank strip: signed-in member now sees the live highlight and \"Your rank\" badge in all seven themes at 1280px and 390px; mobile strip centers the active tier without page scroll; no horizontal overflow.",
      "Light theme: hard-coded #FFC400 on the badge, active tier and The Sparked name failed WCAG AA on the light surface; now var(--gold) (#8a6000 in light, unchanged elsewhere).",
      "Active tier lift was clipped at the top of the scroll container; 6px padding/negative-margin pair gives it room with zero net layout change.",
      "Changelog hero reserves the push slot and shows a readable ship-feed fallback in every theme; feedback insights show \"No themed signal yet.\" in the theme muted color instead of collapsing the grid.",
      "Also reviewed outside this matrix: 28 before/after captures of the /changelog/ feedback-insights block (not retained); the themes empty state reads in the theme muted color in all seven themes.",
      "Element screenshots overlap the sticky header and cookie banner on long mobile sections; these are capture artifacts, not page defects.",
      "Data-only query repairs on /community/ and /leaderboards/ render the same empty states as before for anon visitors; verified through request status, not pixels."
    ],
